// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄
       

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/outputs.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/pointing.h>


#define BASE 0
#define NAV  1
#define SYM  2
#define ADJ  3
#define WAS  4
#define WASS 5
#define EXT  6
#define MOU  7


// MUST BE HERE otherwise mou undefined when parsed 
#include "mouse.dtsi"

/* &mt { */
/*   quick-tap-ms = <100>; */
/*   global-quick-tap; */
/*   flavor = "tap-preferred"; */
/*   tapping-term-ms = <170>; */
/* }; */

/ {
    behaviors {
                td_boot: tap_dance_bootloader {
                    compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
                    #binding-cells = <0>;
                    tapping-term-ms = <300>;
                    bindings = <&none>, <&bootloader>;
                };
                td_rst: tap_dance_reset {
                    compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
                    #binding-cells = <0>;
                    tapping-term-ms = <300>;
                    bindings = <&none>, <&sys_reset>;
                };
                td_btclr: tap_dance_bt_clear {
                    compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
                    #binding-cells = <0>;
                    tapping-term-ms = <300>;
                    bindings = <&none>, <&bt BT_CLR>;
                };
        hml: home_row_mod_left {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            tapping-term-ms = <280>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <5 6 7 8 9 15 16 17 18 19 26 27 28 29 30 31 35 36 37>;/*  TODO! make a macro */
            hold-trigger-on-release;
        };
        hmr: home_row_mod_right {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            tapping-term-ms = <280>;
            quick-tap-ms = <175>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25 32 33 34>;
            hold-trigger-on-release;
        };
    };
    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos"; 
        combo_esc {
            timeout-ms = <35>;
            key-positions = <17 18>; // H A
            bindings = <&kp ESC>;
            layers = <BASE SYM NAV ADJ>;
        };

        combo_ret {
            timeout-ms = <35>;
            key-positions = <33 36>; // s t
            bindings = <&kp SPACE>;
            layers = <BASE SYM NAV ADJ>;
        };
                
        combo_spc {
            timeout-ms = <35>;
            key-positions = <16 17>; // A E
            bindings = <&kp RET>;
            layers = <BASE SYM NAV ADJ>;
        };

        combo_tab {
            timeout-ms = <35>;
            key-positions = <11 12>; // rt
            bindings = <&kp TAB>;
            layers = <BASE SYM NAV ADJ>;
        };

        combo_bspc {
            timeout-ms = <35>;
            key-positions = <18 19>; // ie
            bindings = <&kp BSPC>;
            layers = <BASE SYM NAV ADJ>;
        };

        combo_del {
            timeout-ms = <35>;
            key-positions = <7 8>; // O U
            bindings = <&kp DEL>;
            layers = <BASE SYM NAV ADJ>;
        };
            /* combo_esc { */
            /*     timeout-ms = <50>; */
            /*     key-positions = <0 1>; */
            /*     bindings = <&kp ESC>; */
            /* }; */
    };

    macros {
        tmux: tmux {
            label = "tmux";
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LC(N)>;
        };

        search: search {
            label = "search";
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LC(C) &kp LC(T) &kp LC(V) &kp RET>;
        };
        select_line: select_line {
            label = "select_line";
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp HOME &kp LS(END)>;
        };

        select_word: select_word {
            label = "select_word";
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LC(LEFT) &kp LC(LS(RIGHT))>;
        };
    };

        keymap {
                compatible = "zmk,keymap";
// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

                base_layer {
label= "BASE"                              ;
 bindings = <

                &kp B       &kp L       &kp D        &kp V         &caps_word           &kp Z       &kp Y        &kp O        &kp U       &kp COMMA
                &hml LGUI N &hml LALT C &hml LCTRL M &hml LSHFT S  &kp G                &kp P       &hmr RSHFT H &hmr RCTRL A &hmr RALT E &hmr RGUI I
    &kp K       &kp Q       &kp X       &kp W        &kp J         &kp F13              &kp K       &kp F        &kp SQT      &kp SEMI    &kp DOT    &kp FSLH
                                        &kp TAB      &lt NAV T     &lt MOU SPACE        &key_repeat &lt SYM R    &kp BSPC
                        >;
                };

// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄


                nav_layer {
label= "NAVI"                              ;
 bindings = <

                &kp N6       &kp N7       &kp N8        &kp N9        &kp N0           &tmux         &kp PG_UP   &search     &select_line  &select_word
                &hml LGUI N1 &hml LALT N2 &hml LCTRL N3 &hml LSHFT N4 &kp N5           &kp DOLLAR    &kp H       &kp J       &kp K         &kp L 
    &kp GRAVE   &kp LC(Y)    &kp LC(Z)    &kp LC(V)     &kp LC(C)     &tog WAS         &kp CARET     &kp F       &kp T       &kp N3        &kp STAR      &trans      
                                          &trans        &trans        &trans           &mo ADJ       &kp PG_DN   &kp PG_DN                           
                        >;                                                                                                                         
                };                                                                                                                                 

// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄


                sym_layer {
label= "SYM"                               ;
 bindings = <

                &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS    &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS  &kp CARET      &kp DOLLAR      &kp PRCNT            &trans   &kp BSLH  &kp AMPERSAND &kp EXCLAMATION &trans       
                &kp LEFT_BRACKET        &kp RIGHT_BRACKET      &kp LEFT_BRACE &kp RIGHT_BRACE &kp HASH             &trans   &kp LEFT  &kp DOWN      &kp UP          &kp RIGHT 
    &kp GRAVE   &kp STAR                &kp AT                 &kp MINUS      &kp PLUS        &kp EQUAL            &trans   &kp K_BACK   &kp K_FORWARD     &kp C_VOL_DN          &kp C_VOL_UP     &trans        
                                                               &trans         &mo ADJ         &trans              &trans   &trans    &trans      
                        >;
                };

// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄


                adjust_layer {
label= "ADJ"                               ;
 bindings = <

                   &td_rst     &td_btclr    &out OUT_TOG &trans       &tog WAS         &caps_word  &kp F7      &kp F8      &kp F9      &kp F12
                   &td_boot    &bt BT_SEL 0 &bt BT_SEL 1 &bt BT_SEL 2 &tog EXT         &trans      &kp F4      &kp F5      &kp F6      &kp F11  
    &studio_unlock &trans      &trans       &trans       &trans       &trans           &trans      &kp F1      &kp F2      &kp F3      &kp F10     &td_boot         
                                            &trans       &trans       &trans           &trans      &trans      &trans      
                        >;
                };

// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

                was_layer {
label= "WAS"                              ;
 bindings = <

                &kp Q       &kp F       &kp E       &kp R       &kp T                  &kp Y       &kp U       &kp I       &kp O       &kp P
                &kp C       &kp A       &kp W       &kp D       &kp G                  &kp H       &kp J       &kp K       &kp L       &kp SEMI
    &kp LSHFT   &kp Z       &kp X       &kp S       &kp V       &kp B                  &kp N       &kp M       &kp COMMA   &kp DOT     &kp ESC    &tog WAS
                                        &kp LCTRL   &kp SPACE  &lt WASS L              &kp TAB     &kp RET     &kp BSPC
                        >;
                };

// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄


                wass_layer {
label= "WASS"                              ;
 bindings = <

                &kp Q       &kp O       &kp I       &kp R       &kp L                  &trans      &trans      &trans       &trans      &kp P
                &kp COMMA   &kp N       &kp K       &kp TAB     &kp H                  &trans      &trans      &trans       &trans      &kp SEMI
    &kp LCTRL   &kp Y       &kp U       &kp M       &kp ESC     &kp J                  &trans      &trans      &trans       &trans      &kp ESC    &tog WASS
                                        &to BASE    &kp LALT    &trans                 &kp RET     &kp TAB     &kp BSPC
                        >;
                };

// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄


                ext_layer {
label= "EXT"                              ;
 bindings = <

                &kp Q       &kp W       &kp R       &kp T       &kp Y                  &kp F2      &kp F3      &kp F4      &kp F5      &kp P
                &kp F1      &kp S       &kp H       &kp RET     &kp G                  &kp H       &kp J       &kp K       &kp L       &kp SEMI
    &kp F3      &kp Z       &kp X       &kp C       &kp ESC     &kp B                  &kp N       &kp M       &kp COMMA   &kp DOT     &kp ESC    &tog EXT
                                        &kp LSHFT   &kp SPACE   &kp LCTRL              &kp TAB     &kp RET     &kp BSPC
                        >;
                };

// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

                mou_layer {
label= "MOU"                              ;
 bindings = <

                U_WH_L      U_WH_R  &mkp MCLK     &kp DOLLAR    &kp PRCNT              &kp HASH &kp BSLH &kp AMPERSAND &kp EXCLAMATION &trans       
                U_WH_U      U_WH_D  &mkp RCLK     &mkp LCLK     &trans                 &trans   U_MS_L   U_MS_D         U_MS_U         U_MS_R 
    &kp GRAVE   &kp STAR    &kp AT  &kp MINUS     &kp ESC       &trans                 &trans   &trans   &trans         &trans         &trans     &trans        
                                    &trans        &mo ADJ       &trans                 &trans   &trans   &trans      
                        >;
                };

// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

/*                 fac_layer { */
/* // ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓ */
/* label= "FAC"                              ; */
/* // ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛ */
/* //             ┏━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━┓   ┏━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━┳━━━━━━━━━━━┓ */
/* //             ┃     Q     ┃     W     ┃     R     ┃     T     ┃     Y     ┃   ┃     f2    ┃     f3    ┃     f4    ┃    f5     ┃     P     ┃ */
/* //             ┣━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━┫   ┣━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━┫ */
/* //             ┃     F1    ┃     S     ┃     h     ┃   RET     ┃     G     ┃   ┃     H     ┃     J     ┃     K     ┃     L     ┃     ;     ┃ */
/* // ┏━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━┫   ┣━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━╋━━━━━━━━━━━┓ */
/* // ┃  F2       ┃     Z     ┃     X     ┃     C     ┃   ESC     ┃     B     ┃   ┃     N     ┃     M     ┃     ,     ┃     .     ┃   esc     ┃    ext    ┃ */
